{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"元年春王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"二月辛酉，葬我君宣公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"無冰。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"三月，作丘甲。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"夏，臧孫許及晉侯盟于赤棘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"秋，王師敗績于茅戎。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"冬十月。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"元年春，晉侯使瑕嘉平戎于王，單襄公如晉拜成。劉康公徼戎，將遂伐之。叔服曰：「背盟而欺大國，此必敗。背盟不祥，欺大國不義，神人弗助，將何以勝？」不聽，遂伐茅戎。三月癸未，敗績于徐吾氏。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"為齊難故，作丘甲。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"聞齊將出楚師，夏，盟于赤棘。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"秋，王人來告敗。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_133_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_133","textTraditional":"冬，臧宣叔令脩賦、繕完、具守備，曰：「齊、楚結好，我新與晉盟，晉、楚爭盟，齊師必至。雖晉人伐齊，楚必救之，是齊、楚同我也。知難而有備，乃可以逞。」","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}